{
  "file" : "npc/battleground/bg_common.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wise adventurer, why don't you lend us your power for victory?",
      "translation" : "睿智的冒险者，何不借助你的力量，助我们赢得胜利？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What's the reason for the Battle?",
      "translation" : "为什么要战斗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tell me about General Guillaume",
      "translation" : "告诉我吉约姆将军的事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Maroll's great king, Marcel Marollo VII, is very sick lately.",
      "translation" : "马罗尔伟大的国王马塞尔·马罗洛七世最近病得很重。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His Majesty has declared that he will be leaving the future of Maroll to me or the 3rd prince, General Guillaume.",
      "translation" : "陛下宣布，他将把马罗尔的未来交给我或三王子吉约姆将军。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "General Guillaume may have an advantage in this battle as he is the great general of Maroll, but that doesn't automatically mean he'll win.",
      "translation" : "吉约姆将军是马罗尔的大将军，在这场战斗中或许占有优势，但这并不代表他一定会赢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to win this battle so that I can bring prosperity to the people of Maroll. They've suffered enough from war...",
      "translation" : "我想赢得这场战斗，为马罗尔的人民带来繁荣。他们已经饱受战争之苦..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I want to join you.",
      "translation" : "是的，我愿意加入你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you so much. I feel like I can win with the help of adventurers like you.",
      "translation" : "非常感谢。有了像你这样的冒险者相助，我觉得自己一定能赢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, please go downstairs and join your comrades in sharpening their skills to fight the enemy!",
      "translation" : "现在请到楼下，和同伴一起磨练战斗技巧，迎战敌人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For Maroll!",
      "translation" : "为了马罗尔！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 3rd Prince Guillaume is the great general of Maroll.",
      "translation" : "三王子吉约姆是马罗尔的大将军。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's a waste of time to explain to you how great a leader or warlord he is, since he commands the great military power of Maroll.",
      "translation" : "他统率着马罗尔强大的军队，至于他是多么出色的领袖或战将，我就不必多说了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately, there's something he and his followers are unaware of:",
      "translation" : "可惜，他和他的追随者都没有意识到一件事："
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do the people of Maroll really want them to spend so much money on military power?",
      "translation" : "马罗尔的人民真的希望他们把这么多钱花在军力上吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We have suffered enough from wars.",
      "translation" : "我们已经受够了战争。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I believe weapons aren't the best way to bring prosperity to a nation.",
      "translation" : "我相信，武器并不是让国家繁荣的最佳途径。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I do not wish to shed blood, but I have no choice but to fight for the possibility of peace and for the sake of my people.",
      "translation" : "我不愿流血，但为了和平的可能，也为了我的人民，我别无选择，只能战斗。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I want to join you.",
      "translation" : "是的，我愿意加入你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you so much. I feel like I can win with the help of adventurers like you.",
      "translation" : "非常感谢。有了像你这样的冒险者相助，我觉得自己一定能赢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, please go downstairs and join your comrades in sharpening their skills to fight the enemy!",
      "translation" : "现在请到楼下，和同伴一起磨练战斗技巧，迎战敌人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Prince Croix]",
      "translation" : "[克鲁瓦王子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Prince Croix",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For Maroll!",
      "translation" : "为了马罗尔！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hot-blooded adventurer, we need your ability to win this battle.",
      "translation" : "热血的冒险者，我们需要你的本领来赢得这场战斗。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What's the reason for the Battle?",
      "translation" : "为什么要战斗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tell me about Prince Croix",
      "translation" : "告诉我克鲁瓦王子的事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Our great king, Marcel Marollo VII, is very sick lately.",
      "translation" : "我们伟大的国王马塞尔·马罗洛七世最近病得很重。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His Majesty has declared that he has chosen either me or Prince Croix as the next king amongst his 9 sons.",
      "translation" : "陛下已宣布，在他的九个儿子中，他选择了我或克鲁瓦王子作为下一任国王。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Two kings can't share a nation! Only the one victorious from His Majesty's appointed battle will be enthroned.",
      "translation" : "一个国家不能有两位国王！只有在陛下指定的战斗中获胜的人才能继承王位。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is, however, not just a battle between us. This battle will determine the future of this country.",
      "translation" : "然而，这不只是我们两人之间的战斗。这场战斗将决定这个国家的未来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I pledge on my honor to prove that I'm the one who can protect this Maroll from outside threats.",
      "translation" : "我以荣誉起誓，证明自己才是能够保护马罗尔免受外敌威胁的人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I want to join you.",
      "translation" : "是的，我愿意加入你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to my army, comrade.",
      "translation" : "欢迎加入我的军队，战友。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your eyes tell me that you're a soldier that I can trust.",
      "translation" : "从你的眼神中，我看得出你是值得信赖的战士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, go upstairs and apply for battle with your comrades.",
      "translation" : "现在上楼，和同伴一起报名参战。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sure they'll welcome you whole-heartedly!",
      "translation" : "我相信他们一定会热烈欢迎你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll be the one who will capture the flag!",
      "translation" : "我会亲自夺下旗帜！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 5th Prince Croix is currently titled as the Prime Minister of Maroll.",
      "translation" : "五王子克鲁瓦目前担任马罗尔的首相。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He thinks all national matters of a nation can be discussed and determined on a desk,",
      "translation" : "他认为，一个国家的所有国事都可以坐在书桌前讨论并决定，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and believes in peaceful co-existence with other countries.",
      "translation" : "并且相信国家之间可以和平共处。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He's too ignorant to admit that so-called peace is built on countless lives that are sacrificed in wars while normal citizens and upper classes can live, oblivious to the horrors that allow them to live that way.",
      "translation" : "他太过无知，不明白所谓的和平，是无数人在战争中牺牲换来的；普通百姓和上层人士却能对这种生活背后的残酷视而不见。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He's too naive to understand the reality....",
      "translation" : "他太天真，根本不懂现实..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can't leave Maroll to someone like him who lives in a dream!",
      "translation" : "我不能把马罗尔交给一个活在梦里的人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "His unrealistic beliefs will drown this country in poverty and make the people weak. If he becomes the king, Maroll will never rest from the onslaughts of other countries.",
      "translation" : "他不切实际的信念会让国家陷入贫困，使人民变得软弱。他若成为国王，马罗尔将永无宁日，只能不断承受他国的侵袭。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to teach him what makes this small country so powerful and prosperous. It's military power!",
      "translation" : "我想让他明白，这个小国为何如此强大繁荣。靠的就是军力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to join your army!",
      "translation" : "我要加入你的军队！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to my army, comrade.",
      "translation" : "欢迎加入我的军队，战友。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your eyes tell me that you're a soldier that I can trust.",
      "translation" : "从你的眼神中，我看得出你是值得信赖的战士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, go upstairs and apply for battle from your comrades.",
      "translation" : "现在上楼，和同伴一起报名参战。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sure they'll welcome you whole-heartedly!",
      "translation" : "我相信他们一定会热烈欢迎你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[General Guillaume]",
      "translation" : "[吉约姆将军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "General Guillaume",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll be the one who will capture the flag!",
      "translation" : "我会亲自夺下旗帜！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Teleporter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Teleporter]",
      "translation" : "[传送师]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Teleporter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you wish to leave the battlefield? Use my services to return to town.",
      "translation" : "你要离开战场吗？使用我的服务即可返回城镇。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Teleporter",
      "state" : "translated",
